# Always deploy live

When finishing work that should appear on the live site (https://www.bilgeyismirzazada.com), deploy immediately. Do not ask Eldar first and do not wait for a separate "deploy et" message.

Use the existing production flow: SFTP changed files to `/root/MotionPortolio.Api` on `164.92.180.47`, then `docker compose build` and `up -d --no-deps` for `web` and/or `api` as needed. Rebuild `api` when backend/C# files change; rebuild `web` when Next.js files change.

After deploy, confirm containers started. Do not commit or push unless asked.
